- Do not renumber or restructure days/slots beyond what the request requires.
- Do not invent new tasks or days that were not in the original plan and were not asked for.

Return ONLY the full updated JSON object, with the exact same structure as the existing plan
(title, summary, days[] with day_index/label/slots[], each slot with
task/start_time/duration_minutes/category/subtasks/notes). No explanations, no markdown.
